flowchart TB
    Internet((Internet)) --> FW[pfSense Firewall]
    FW --> Outer[Outer DMZ]
    FW --> Inner[Inner DMZ]
    FW --> HQ[HQ Clients]
    FW --> Remote[Remote Clients]
    Outer --> DNS[BIND DNS pair]
    Outer --> MAIL[Postfix + SpamAssassin]
    Outer --> ADC[Relianoid ADC]
    Inner --> DC[AD DS / DNS pair]
    Inner --> EX[Exchange]
    Inner --> WEB[Apache Web Pair]
    Inner --> PROXY[Tinyproxy]
    Inner --> CA[OpenSSL CA]
    MAIL --> EX
    ADC --> WEB
    CA -. certificates .-> ADC
    CA -. S/MIME .-> EX
